{"id": "22-4746-2-2", "zh": "kī 等词根类（Kyādigaṇa）", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4747-2-5", "zh": "现在讲述 kī 等词根类。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4748-2-19", "zh": "kī、ji、ñā、dhū、pu、bhū、mā、mū、lū。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4749-2-36", "zh": "671. Kyādīhi kṇā（在 kī 等词根之后加 kṇā）〔ka.449；rū.513；nī.930；caṃ.1.1.101……乃至……3.1.81〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4750-2-9", "zh": "在 kī 等表示动作的词根之后，于主动语态中加带 k 附符的词缀 ṇā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4751-2-36", "zh": "672. Kṇāknāsu rasso（在 kṇā、knā 之前变为短音）〔ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105；caṃ.6.1.108；pā.7.3.80〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4752-2-7", "zh": "在这些词缀之前，长音词根变为短音。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4753-2-11", "zh": "kī 表示交换物品（买卖）：kiṇāti、kiṇanti、vikkiṇāti、vikkiṇanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4754-2-11", "zh": "被动语态：kīyati、kiyyati、vikkīyati、vikkiyyati、vikkiyyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4755-2-10", "zh": "使役：vikkāyeti、vikkāyayati、kīṇāpeti、kīṇāpayati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4756-2-20", "zh": "673. Jyādīhi knā（在 ji 等词根之后加 knā）〔ka.449；rū.513；nī.930〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4757-2-7", "zh": "在 ji 等词根之后，于主动语态中加带 k 附符的词缀 nā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4758-2-5", "zh": "jināti、jinanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4759-2-9", "zh": "被动语态：jīyati、jiyyati、jinīyati、jiniyyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4760-2-30", "zh": "使役：jayāpeti、jayāpayati、parājeti、parājayati、parājenti、parājayanti、jināpeti、jināpayati；ajini、jini、ajiniṃsu、jiniṃsu、jinissati、jinissanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4761-2-3", "zh": "ñā 表示了知。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4762-2-39", "zh": "674. Ñāssa ne jā（在 na 之前，ñā 变为 jā）〔ka.470；rū.514；nī.950；caṃ.6.1.107；pā.7.3.70，79〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4763-2-7", "zh": "词缀 nā 在后时，ñā 变为 jā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4764-2-19", "zh": "jānāti、pajānāti、ājānāti、sañjānāti、vijānāti、abhijānāti、parijānāti、paṭijānāti、jānanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4765-2-19", "zh": "被动语态：ñāyati、paññāyati、aññāyati、saññāyati、viññāyati、abhiññāyati、pariññāyati、paṭiññāyati、ñāyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4766-2-18", "zh": "使役：ñāpeti、ñāpayati、ñāpenti、ñāpayanti、jānāpeti、jānāpayati、jānāpenti、jānāpayanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4767-2-7", "zh": "被动语态：ñāpīyati、saññāpīyati、jānāpīyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4768-2-22", "zh": "675. Ñāssa sanāssa nāyo timhi（连同 nā 的 ñā，在 ti 之前变为 nāya）〔ka.509；rū.516；nī.1022〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4769-2-13", "zh": "连同 nā 的 ñā 在 ti 之前变为 nāya；依规则拆分，在 anti、ante 之前也是如此。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4770-2-3", "zh": "nāyati。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4770-4-21", "zh": "“比丘们，他一再审察，了知（panāyati）种种义理，因此被称为毗婆尸。”〔dī.ni.2.41-44〕", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4770-22-23", "zh": "nāyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4770-24-39", "zh": "“无相的事物不被认知（nāyare）”〔visuddhi 1.174〕——这是圣典原文。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4771-2-13", "zh": "在 eyya 等语尾之前：jāneyya、jāneyyuṃ、jāneyyāsi、jāneyyātha、jāneyyāmi、jāneyyāma。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4772-2-3", "zh": "变为 u 的情况：jāneyyāmu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4773-2-23", "zh": "eyyāma 变为 emu 的例子：“我们怎能认识他（jānemu）”〔jā.2.22.7〕——这是圣典原文。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4774-2-20", "zh": "676. Eyyassiyāñā vā（eyya 可选地变为 iyā、ñā）〔ka.508；rū.515；nī.1021〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4775-2-24", "zh": "在 ñā 之后，eyya 变为 iyā 和 ñā；由于 vā 一词，eyyuṃ 等也分别替换为 ñū、ñāsi、ñātha、ñāmi、ñāma，eyyaṃ 则变为 ñaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4776-2-3", "zh": "jāniyā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4777-2-20", "zh": "677. Ñāmhi jaṃ（在 ñā 之前变为 jaṃ）〔ka.470；rū.514；nī.950〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4778-2-8", "zh": "替换形 ñā 在后时，连同 nā 的 ñā 变为 jaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4779-2-5", "zh": "jaññā、vijaññā。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4780-2-7", "zh": "依规则拆分，在 ñū 等之前也变为 jaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4780-8-56", "zh": "“造了恶业，却希望别人不知道我（jaññū）”〔su.ni.127；vibha.894 作‘jaññā’〕，“我要了知（vijaññaṃ）远离之法”〔另作 gavesitabbaṃ〕，“如果我们知道（jaññāmu）谁是持戒而慷慨的人”〔jā.2.22.1301〕——这些是圣典原文。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4780-57-68", "zh": "‘jaññāsi、jaññātha、jaññāmi、jaññāma’这些形式也成立。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4781-2-20", "zh": "678. Īssatyādīsu knālopo（在 ī、ssati 等之前，knā 脱落）〔ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4782-2-9", "zh": "在 ī 等语尾和 ssati 等语尾之前，knā 可选地脱落。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4783-2-47", "zh": "aññāsi、abbhaññāsi、ajāni、aññāsuṃ、aññaṃsu、abbhaññaṃsu、jāniṃsu、aññāsi、abbhaññāsi、ajāni、aññittha、jānittha、aññāsiṃ、abbhaññāsiṃ、ajāniṃ、jāniṃ、aññāsimhā、ajānimhā、jānimhā、ñāssati、jānissati、ñāssanti、jānissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4784-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：viññāyissati、viññāyissanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4785-2-21", "zh": "679. Ssassa hi kamme（被动语态中 ssa 变为 hi）〔ka.517；rū.488；nī.1105〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4786-2-8", "zh": "在 ñā 之后，被动语态中的 ssa 可选地变为 hi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4787-2-3", "zh": "paññāyihi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4787-4-23", "zh": "“这些年轻的女子将会显现出来（paññāyihinti）”〔jā.2.17.197〕——这是圣典原文。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4787-24-28", "zh": "paññāyissati、paññāyissanti 等。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "22-4788-2-10", "zh": "dhū 表示摇动；在 knā 之前变为短音：dhunāti、dhunanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4789-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：dhunīyati、dhunīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4790-2-5", "zh": "使役：dhunāpeti、dhunāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4791-2-7", "zh": "pu 表示净化：punāti、punanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4792-2-9", "zh": "bhū 表示到达；变为短音：abhisambhunāti、abhisambhunanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4792-10-14", "zh": "nā 变为 ṇā 时：abhisambhuṇāti、abhisambhuṇanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4793-2-12", "zh": "mā 表示度量；依大规则（mahāvutti），词根末音变为 i：mināti、nimmināti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4794-2-9", "zh": "被动语态：upamīyati、upamīyanti、nimmīyati、nimmīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4795-2-31", "zh": "使役：nagaraṃ māpeti（建造城市）、māpayati、māpīyati、māpīyanti；nimmini、nimminiṃsu、māpesi、māpayi、māpesuṃ、māpayuṃ、nimminissati、nimminissanti、māpessati、māpessanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4796-2-5", "zh": "mū 表示系缚：munāti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4797-2-9", "zh": "lū 表示切割；变为短音：lunāti、lunanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4798-2-5", "zh": "被动语态：lūyati、lūyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4799-2-5", "zh": "使役：lāvayati、lāvayanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4800-2-4", "zh": "被动语态：lāvīyati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4801-2-4", "zh": "kī 等词根类讲述完毕。", "confidence": 90}
